====Predicative====
{{head|ru|predicative|head=охо́та}}

# what makes...do something; what do/does...see in something; what do/does...get out of something
#: {{uxi|ru|'''Охо́та''' [[он|ему́]] [[занима́ться]] [[этот|э́тим]]?!|What makes him do it?!}}
#: {{uxi|ru|[[что за|Что́]] [[вы|вам]] [[что за|за]] '''охо́та'''?!|What makes you do it?!}}

===Etymology 2===
Came into use as taboo avoidance of an earlier word {{m|ru|лов}}; derived from Etymology 1.

====Noun====
